  Star Icon

  Solid star, filled with currentColor. Used by the product-card rating strip, where two
  layers of five stars are overlaid and the upper layer is clipped to the rating fraction.

  Design stroke: none — this is a fill-only shape, so the .icon--stroke-* modifiers do not
  apply. The design's 0.5px corner radius is not reproduced; it is sub-pixel at the 12px
  render size.

  @param {string} [class] - Sizing classes (optional)

  @example
  {% render 'icon-star', class: 'h-3 w-3' %}
